<%- include('head') %><%- include('header') %><main id="main" class="page-container"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / STORIES OVER TIME</p><h1>TIMELINE<span>时间轴</span></h1><p>从最近写下的文章开始，沿着时间往前看。</p></div><span class="archive-orbit" aria-hidden="true">◷</span></div><div class="archive-layout"><div class="archive-intro"><b><%= posts.length %></b><span>篇文章</span><p>按年份和月份排列，<br>想找哪段经历，就从这里开始。</p></div><div class="archive-timeline"><% for(const year of [...new Set(posts.map(p=>p.date.slice(0,4)))]){ %><h2><%= year %><span>YEAR IN REVIEW</span></h2><% for(const month of [...new Set(posts.filter(p=>p.date.startsWith(year)).map(p=>p.date.slice(0,7)))]){ %><h3><%= month.slice(5) %> 月 <small><%= posts.filter(p=>p.date.startsWith(month)).length %> ENTRIES</small></h3><% for(const p of posts.filter(p=>p.date.startsWith(month))){ %><a class="archive-entry" href="<%= postUrl(p) %>"><time><%= p.date.slice(5).replace('-','.') %></time><span><small><%= p.category %> / DAY <%= p.day %></small><strong><%= p.title %></strong></span><b>↗</b></a><% } } } %></div></div></main><%- include('footer') %>
